## 15. Digital Transformation Strategy

### 15.1 Digital Tools Adoption
- **Process Owner:** Digital Transformation Team
- **Tools Used:** Digital Adoption Platforms (e.g., WalkMe, Whatfix), Project Management Tools (e.g., Asana, Trello)
- **Requirements:**
