### 15.3 Cybersecurity Measures
- **Process Owner:** IT Security Team
- **Tools Used:** Security Information and Event Management (SIEM) Tools (e.g., Splunk, LogRhythm), Endpoint Protection Software (e.g., CrowdStrike, Symantec)
